{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43489","headline":"尚书郎上直闻春漏 · 无名氏","name":"尚书郎上直闻春漏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"地即尚书省，人惟鸳鹭行。\n审时传玉漏，直夜递星郎。\n历历闻仙暑，泠泠出建章。\n自空来断续，随月散凄锵。\n物静知声远，寒轻觉夜长。\n听余残月落，曙色满东方。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43489.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43489","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}